12:27:29 PM [express] POST /api/ai/chat 200 in 41370ms :: {"response":"Your Body Mass Index (BMI) is calculated as follows:\n\nBMI = weight (kg) / \\[height (m)]^2\n\nFirst convert your weight to kilograms: 77 kg\n\nThen convert your height to meters: 5 ft 11 inches = 1.80 m\n\nBMI = 77 kg / (1.80 m)^2 = 77 kg / 3.24 sq m ≈ 23.57\n\nTherefore, your BMI is approximately 23.57.","followUpQuestions":[]}
